      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比我期待中的还要好吃。下次我想延长30分钟的\r\n停留时间，再尝尝别的餐点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c100d992ecb6fc720732db147095ccb7569308a25f12432b496717738ca8ce",
