    {
      "uid": "zhcn:718a45952dca7053b9e57d00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这之后，我还有再去看一家的计划。\r\n话虽如此，要去的不是蛋糕店而是咖啡厅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54b872eb8e44ca939619d9f275ae87712d91868e6fabc4b5971e484a5c72586",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1037/storytimeline_041037006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c3f07a150ab446a00dda3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我可以跟你一起去吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04440304af3f533db201820381889c98ba0cc7dda46321c356538c7dc571c7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1037/storytimeline_041037006.json",
