    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55234f2d619ca7bd4a3cb043",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是今天的重点，『Moon Cafe』。从训练员身后的第二个\r\n拐角处穿过住宅区，走大约15分钟就到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d16b3934f5e574d667dde072b5af921c64134cf7f027c1c0df7588120a1dcc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
