      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了提升实力，将举办夏季集训，\r\n我们正在讨论训练日程时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "229eeef6d11a21d9f7608173291c3b962f85cb66119aed09be2ecd677dda94df",
